@context: Variables — declare with @var, change with SET, read the page with EXTRACT, show with PRINT.
@title: variables

@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000
@var: {product} = Snow Boots

STEP 1: Use a variable anywhere a value goes
    NAVIGATE to {site}/shop.html
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR '{product}'
    VERIFY that 'Added {product}' is present

STEP 2: Read a value off the page
    # EXTRACT reads a control's value, or the text an element shows.
    EXTRACT the 'Cart total' into {total}
    PRINT "The cart holds {product} for {total}"
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '{total}'

STEP 3: SET a variable mid-hunt
    SET {product} = Steppe Map
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR '{product}'
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 2' is present
    # Prints every variable and the scope it came from.
    DEBUG VARS

DONE.
